ki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Lemma 8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"69–70"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"80–81"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述、源证明和自指构造已读；Lemma5.1有限证明片段算术化及双参数固定点未独立重建"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致的固定原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n,\\Pi_n\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_n}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_n}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d04e3c8a5885c18\" href=\"?note=5d04e3c8a5885c18\" title=\"67-df-partially-conservative\">67-df-partially-conservative</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar k)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar k)\\)</span> 是指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的无捕获数词实例。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T\\nvdash\\xi(\\bar k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\bigl(\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\to\\xi(\\bar k)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_n}\n\\bigl(\\xi(\\bar k),T\\cup\\{\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;T\\nvdash\\xi(\\bar k)\\\\\n&amp;\\land T\\vdash\\bigl(\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\to\\xi(\\bar k)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ConsSent}_{\\Sigma_n}\n\\bigl(\\xi(\\bar k),T\\cup\\{\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma5.8；专为证明 Theorem4.8 补入的直接机制节点。关键第一项是不可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\xi(k)\">\\(T\\nvdash\\xi(k)\\)</span>，已核对PDF80图像，文本抽取多处丢失否定斜线。</p>\n<p>来源用双参数自指定义辅助 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，并以一个PR公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&#39;\">\\(\\delta&#39;\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi_{\\delta&#39;}(0)\">\\(\\xi_{\\delta&#39;}(0)\\)</span> 的可证明性。若存在标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta&#39;\">\\(\\delta&#39;\\)</span> 见证，取最小见证及辅助链会推出与一致性冲突的结论，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\xi_{\\delta&#39;}(0)\">\\(T\\nvdash\\xi_{\\delta&#39;}(0)\\)</span>；递归蕴涵推进到所有实例。最后用 Lemma5.1 的有限证明片段和自指等式证明第三项的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 保守性。源证明已读；其有限片段编码及多参数自指的完整形式化没有在本次重建，保留受限状态。</p>\n<p>前两项及第三项还推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\">\\(T\\nvdash\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\)</span>：若该蕴涵可证，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})+\\xi(\\bar k)\">\\(T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})+\\xi(\\bar k)\\)</span> 不一致；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 的矛盾句应用保守性，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\">\\(T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\)</span> 不一致，进而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\">\\(T\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\)</span>，违背第一项。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-partially-conservative","status":"resolved","id":"5d04e3c8a5885c18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-partially-conservative]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":f