ta'}(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta'","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\xi_{\\delta'}(0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"T\\nvdash\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})+\\xi(\\bar k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{k+1})","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{k+1})","display":false}],"bytes":2916,"backlinks":[{"id":"19405805e97916e7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain]] 的 $\\xi$。令 $\\theta_0=\\xi(\\bar0)$、$\\theta_{k+1}=\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})$。这些句子有效枚举，且与 $E_\\xi$ 相对等价。每个 $T+\\neg\\theta_j$ 一致；链的反向蕴涵使它推出其余 $\\theta_k$，因此该有效公理化不可冗余。蕴涵句 $\\theta_{k+1}$ 一般不在 $\\Pi_n$ 中。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain]]"}],"outgoing":["851cd80e64893935","5d04e3c8a5885c18","cd051851df5d2aa2"]}